cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "N5NEMS-SIC-processing: sea ice concentration retrieval and graph neural network gap-filling for Nimbus-5 NEMS, 1972-1973"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Idagsa/N5NEMS-SIC-processing"
authors:
  - family-names: Andersen
    given-names: Ida Grum-Schwensen
    affiliation: "Technical University of Denmark, Department of Space Research and Technology"
  - family-names: Tonboe
    given-names: Rasmus Tage
    affiliation: "Technical University of Denmark, Department of Space Research and Technology"
abstract: >-
  Processing code for a daily sea ice concentration retrieval from the
  Nimbus-5 Nimbus-E Microwave Spectrometer (NEMS), 17 December 1972 to
  31 October 1973, with an ERA5-driven radiative-transfer correction and a
  hybrid one- and two-channel algorithm, and for a spatially complete 14-day
  NEMS/ESMR product in which remaining voids are reconstructed with a graph
  neural network.
keywords:
  - sea ice concentration
  - passive microwave
  - Nimbus-5
  - NEMS
  - ESMR
  - graph neural network
  - climate data record
